From: DroidDeck Team <dev@droiddeck.org>
Subject: [PATCH] loader: include util/timespec.h in loader_wayland_helper.c

Fixes implicit declaration of timespec_sub_saturate when building with
wayland platform support.

diff --git a/src/loader/loader_wayland_helper.c b/src/loader/loader_wayland_helper.c
index 5953f3e..960264b 100644
--- a/src/loader/loader_wayland_helper.c
+++ b/src/loader/loader_wayland_helper.c
@@ -24,6 +24,7 @@
 #include <errno.h>
 
 #include "util/perf/cpu_trace.h"
+#include "util/timespec.h"
 
 #include "loader_wayland_helper.h"
 
